    {
      "name": "dsh-realtime-voice",
      "title": {
        "en": "Realtime voice input",
        "zh": "实时语音输入"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Superseded by dsh-voice-companion ≥0.4.0 — its dictation, polish and translation modes now live in that plugin; this package gets no new features. Continuous dictation plus cleanup and dictation-translation: speak, and every two neighbouring phrases are polished together before landing in the field — fillers removed, self-corrections followed, Chinese spoken and English written. Exposes a voiceInput service other plugins can attach to.",
        "zh": "已被 dsh-voice-companion ≥0.4.0 取代：听写、排版、口述翻译都并入那个插件，本包不再接新功能。 连续听写 + 自动排版 + 口述翻译：两句相邻的话一起校对了再插入，去口头语、接住「不对，我是说…」、中文说成英文。并把能力暴露成 voiceInput 服务，别的输入插件可直接接入。"
      },
      "icon": "plugins/realtime-voice/icon.svg",
      "author": "Feahter",
