    {
      "name": "dsh-voice-companion",
      "title": {
        "en": "Voice companion",
        "zh": "语音看板娘"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "语音看板娘 0.6：设置面板收成「语音管家设置」一页，形象、声音、主题分组可改；挂断会中止本次通话的 /turn 请求，人声打断后把触发停播的那 220 毫秒语音交给识别，麦克风意外断开时结束当前通话并提示重连。形象仍是自研的 3D 发光核（单文件 WebGL，不依赖 three.js、不加载贴图），五套状态调色板、87 个样式 token 可改，跟模型说一句就能换主题并存成自己的。面板只做两件事：语音输入（通话逐句朗读、输入框听写、按住热键说话）与派活给 DSH。",
        "en": "Voice companion 0.6: the settings panel is one sheet with grouped appearance, voice and theme sections. Hanging up aborts the call in-flight /turn request, a spoken interruption hands the 220 ms that stopped playback to recognition, and an unexpected microphone disconnect ends the call with a reconnect hint. The mascot is still an original 3D surface (one WebGL file, no three.js, no textures) with five state palettes and 87 style tokens; say one sentence to restyle it and save your own theme. The panel keeps two jobs: voice input (call-mode speech, composer dictation, hold-to-talk) and handing work to DSH."
      },
      "icon": "plugins/voice-companion/icon.svg",
      "author": "Feahter",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Feahter/dsh-plugins/tree/main/plugins/voice-companion",
      "repository": {
