    {
      "name": "dsh-archive-rsi",
      "title": {
        "en": "Session archive + PDCA alchemy",
        "zh": "归档会话与 PDCA 炼金"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "0.5.0 把常驻工具面从 11 个压到 3 个（session_archive 归档；rsi 计划/运行/状态；rsi_apply 采纳/回滚），工具 schema 7352B → 5231B，省掉的目录开销是你每一步都要付的；每次启动的自动 run 结束后会自己重估已采纳提案（采纳点两侧各取一半会话，判决写进提案），「改完上下文 → 再度量」不再靠人记得去查；不可采纳的只读建议不再落成提案，只留在发现里。数据仍在 ~/.dsh/archive-rsi/，只读镜像 Harness 的归档开关、不改原始会话文件。",
        "en": "0.5.0 compresses the resident tool surface from eleven tools to three (session_archive for curation, rsi for plan/run/status, rsi_apply for act/adopt); the tool catalog shrinks from 7352 B to 5231 B, which is context you pay for every step. The boot-time run now re-measures adopted patches on its own, sampling sessions on both sides of each adoption and recording the verdict; unadoptable advisories stay findings instead of becoming proposals. Data lives in ~/.dsh/archive-rsi/ — a read-only mirror of the Harness archive flag that never modifies original session files."
      },
      "icon": "plugins/archive-rsi/icon.svg",
      "author": "Feahter",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Feahter/dsh-plugins/tree/main/plugins/archive-rsi",
