    {
      "name": "dsh-360",
      "title": {
        "en": "dsh-360 — two health checks in one",
        "zh": "dsh-360 两面体检"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": " 0.2.3 收紧打分口径：跨文件冲突只在拿到组合级 detectConflicts 结果时给分，缺数据记 N/A 而不是默认满分；analyze/score/report 三件套与 RUBRIC.md 对齐，并补了锁住该口径的测试。",
        "en": " 0.2.3 tightens the rubric: cross-file conflicts are graded only when a composition-level detectConflicts result exists — missing data is N/A, never a default full score; analyze, score and report now follow RUBRIC.md, and tests pin the rule."
