    {
      "name": "dsh-voice-control",
      "title": {
        "en": "Voice control",
        "zh": "语音控制"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "已被 dsh-voice-companion ≥0.4.0 取代：按住说话热键与按会话路由都并入那个插件，本包不再接新功能。 按住 Ctrl+Shift+Space 说话，这句话被送进「该去的那个 Session」，回复用语音播回来。路由是一个纯函数（17 个单测覆盖）：显式新开 → 新建会话；标题强匹配 → 回到那个会话；「继续」这类普通接续 → 最近且唯一的会话；「回到 X」但 X 谁也不是 → 不猜，改成播报候选让你说序号。错路由比不路由更糟，所以 confidence < 0.6 一律转成确认。Host 半片持有 API key、做语音合成与 sessionController 调度，浏览器半片负责录音、HUD 与播报，两边走同源 HTTP（health/plan/dispatch/speak/transcribe）。热键与声音可在 localStorage 覆盖。",
        "en": "Superseded by dsh-voice-companion ≥0.4.0 — its hold-to-talk hotkey and session routing now live in that plugin; this package gets no new features. Hold Ctrl+Shift+Space, speak, and the utterance is delivered to the Session it belongs to; the reply is spoken back. Routing is one pure function covered by 17 unit tests: an explicit new-session phrase creates one, a strong title match resumes it, a plain \"continue\" goes to the single most recent candidate, and \"back to X\" where X matches nothing is never guessed — it speaks the candidates and asks for a number. A wrong route is worse than no route, so anything under 0.6 confidence becomes a confirmation. The host half holds the API key, does speech synthesis and drives sessionController; the browser half records, shows the HUD and speaks; both talk over same-origin HTTP (health/plan/dispatch/speak/transcribe). Hotkey and voice are overridable from localStorage."
      },
